# Netlify redirect rules (read at deploy time from the publish directory, which is the repo root).
#
# The editable résumé sources and their PDF build script live in /resume-src/ so the PDFs can be
# regenerated locally (node resume-src/build-pdfs.mjs). They are never served publicly: the "!"
# forces a 404 even though the files exist in the deploy. The public PDFs are in /downloads/.
/resume-src     /404   404!
/resume-src/*   /404   404!
